---
description: Synced files require focused changes
globs: "english/**,si.go,bigbytes.go,big.go"
alwaysApply: true
---

`english/`, `si.go`, `bigbytes.go` and `big.go` are generated by the upstream sync job. Avoid
unrelated changes in them, but make the smallest compatible correction when a reported failing test
shows a defect there. Do not leave a demonstrated defect unfixed merely because the file is synced.